    "content": "<p><strong>Want to Own a Franchise?</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’re not looking for employees, we’re looking for one passionate operator to own and grow the House of Handsome brand in Red Deer.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our proven, high-volume model comes with recurring revenue from day one. You get the brand, marketing, tech stack, and full operational support, while you bring the drive to run it.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Why Join Us?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Revenue from Day One: Inherit a trusted brand, 1,000+ Google reviews, and a steady membership pipeline.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full Marketing Machine: Ads, UGC content, influencer partnerships, and more, all managed centrally.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Proven Tech: Centralized bookings, automated SMS, and optimized rebooking.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Support from Day One: Playbooks, training, SOPs, and quality control to ensure success.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What We’re Looking For:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrepreneurs with business experience in retail, hospitality, or small business.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A commitment to Red Deer or local business growth.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"228\"><strong>Ready to Own Your Franchise?</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you’re ready to invest in a growing, successful brand, let’s talk!</span></p>\n<p>[contact-form-7 id=\"9870\"]</p>",
